 "NetworkOutput"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "e451bff0-10d2-7a48-b94c-5759d9cd7113"],
 "\[LineSeparator]is an option for ApplySegmentationNetwork. Can be \
\"Segmentation\" (default) to return the segmentation, \"Confidence\" to \
return the per-voxel class confidence (see ClassConfidence), or \"Both\" to \
return {segmentation, confidence}."
}], "Usage",
